OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Tory MP admits altering image
OL,4,Aof passport to access gambling website
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Conservative MP has admitted
OL,7,Fillegally altering a date on an image
OL,8,Fof her passport in order to access a
OL,9,Fgambling website.
OL,11,FKatie Wallis, who uses female pronouns
OL,12,Fand was formerly known as Jamie Wallis,
OL,13,Fwas due to stand trial on two charges
OL,14,Fof possessing a false passport and
OL,15,Fpossessing a false passport with
OL,16,Fimproper intention.
OL,18,FWallis, who represented Bridgend from
OL,19,F2019 to 2024, has been found formally
OL,20,Fnot guilty of those charges after
OL,21,Fagreeing to plead guilty to a new
OL,22,Fcharge under the Computer Misuse Act.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
